---
// src/components/Services.astro
---
<section id="servicios" class="py-24 px-6 container mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Soluciones de Software Adaptadas a la Escala de tu Negocio</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-400">Elige la arquitectura según tu objetivo, no agregues tecnología porque sí.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        
        <!-- Nivel 1 -->
        <div class="bg-[#0A0A0A] border border-white/10 p-8 rounded-3xl hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col">
            <span class="inline-block bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-6 w-fit">NIVEL 1</span>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Presencia Profesional</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-8 flex-grow">Para negocios que necesitan estar en Google correctamente y digitalizar procesos básicos.</p>
            
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-300">
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> Diseño 100% Responsive</li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> Formularios de Google / Excel</li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> SEO Técnico Básico</li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> Integración con WhatsApp</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="/servicios/desarrollo-web" class="mt-8 text-sm font-bold text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 inline-flex items-center gap-2 group">
                Conocer desarrollo web <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">&rarr;</span>
            </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Nivel 2 (Destacado) -->
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0A0A0A] to-[#0d1f18] border border-emerald-500/30 p-8 rounded-3xl hover:border-emerald-400 transform md:-translate-y-4 shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(16,185,129,0.1)] transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col">
            <span class="inline-block bg-emerald-500 text-black text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-6 w-fit">NIVEL 2</span>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Web Empresarial</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-8 flex-grow">Cuando necesitas gestionar datos, clientes, ventas y automatizar tu negocio.</p>
            
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-300">
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> Base de Datos Propia</li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> Panel de Administración</li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> Autenticación de Usuarios</li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> Emails Automatizados</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="/servicios/desarrollo-software-a-medida" class="mt-8 text-sm font-bold text-[#00FF85] hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-2 group">
                Ver soluciones de software a medida <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">&rarr;</span>
            </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Nivel 3 -->
        <div class="bg-[#0A0A0A] border border-white/10 p-8 rounded-3xl hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col">
            <span class="inline-block bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-6 w-fit">NIVEL 3</span>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Plataforma ERP</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-8 flex-grow">Para industrias y sistemas complejos de alta demanda (como tu sistema de stock).</p>
            
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-300">
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> IA y Predicción de Datos</li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> APIs y Lectura OCR</li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> Roles y Permisos (CRM)</li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> Monitoreo en Tiempo Real</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="/servicios/desarrollo-software-a-medida" class="mt-8 text-sm font-bold text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 inline-flex items-center gap-2 group">
                Explorar plataformas y ERP <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">&rarr;</span>
            </a>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>